{"lines": ["In the middle of a church service, a ball of fire burst through the window, and nobody has ever fully explained it.", "Widecombe, Devon, sixteen thirty-eight. Three hundred people sat inside as a storm rolled over the moor.", "Witnesses said a strange darkness fell, then a great fiery ball split in two.", "Four people died, and about sixty were hurt. Some had burnt skin, yet their clothes were not one thread singed.", "The air stank of sulphur. Locals blamed the Devil.", "But a ball of fire that splits, and burns skin but not clothes, sounds like ball lightning.", "Yet science has no accepted explanation for ball lightning, and good data on it is scarce.", "Some think plain lightning struck the tower, and fear inflated the story.", "Was it ball lightning, or an ordinary bolt that frightened witnesses made bigger?"], "words": [["In", 0.0, 0.06], ["the", 0.06, 0.14], ["middle", 0.14, 0.36], ["of", 0.36, 0.54], ["a", 0.54, 0.62], ["church", 0.62, 0.86], ["service,", 0.86, 1.3], ["a", 1.88, 1.98], ["ball", 1.98, 2.18], ["of", 2.18, 2.38], ["fire", 2.38, 2.74], ["burst", 2.74, 3.06], ["through", 3.06, 3.42], ["the", 3.42, 3.52], ["window,", 3.52, 3.82], ["and", 4.3, 4.44], ["nobody", 4.44, 4.74], ["has", 4.74, 5.08], ["ever", 5.08, 5.36], ["fully", 5.36, 5.68], ["explained", 5.68, 6.14], ["it.", 6.14, 6.48], ["Widecombe,", 6.973, 7.48], ["Devon,", 7.76, 7.88], ["sixteen", 8.36, 8.757], ["thirty-eight.", 8.757, 9.38], ["Three", 10.12, 10.32], ["hundred", 10.32, 10.58], ["people", 10.58, 10.9], ["sat", 10.9, 11.22], ["inside", 11.22, 11.46], ["as", 11.46, 12.0], ["a", 12.0, 12.1], ["storm", 12.1, 12.48], ["rolled", 12.48, 12.78], ["over", 12.78, 13.28], ["the", 13.28, 13.4], ["moor.", 13.4, 13.68], ["Witnesses", 14.34, 14.38], ["said", 14.38, 14.74], ["a", 14.74, 14.82], ["strange", 14.82, 15.14], ["darkness", 15.14, 15.7], ["fell,", 15.7, 16.04], ["then", 16.66, 16.7], ["a", 16.7, 16.76], ["great", 16.76, 17.0], ["fiery", 17.0, 17.4], ["ball", 17.4, 17.82], ["